{"id":"2dc58bf648f8b3b2","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-closed-term.md","title":"Closed Term","display":"df-closed-term — Closed Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-closed-term","aliases":["92-df-closed-term"],"display":"df-closed-term — Closed Term","depends_on":["[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-closed-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-closed-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-term — Closed Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> (term, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_G(t) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FV}_G(t)=\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_G(t) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FV}_G(t)=\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>闭项：不含自由变量的项</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(t) = \\emptyset\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(t) = \\emptyset\\)</span></li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S0\">\\(S0\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SS0 + S0\">\\(SS0 + S0\\)</span></li>\n<li>反例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1 + S0\">\\(v_1 + S0\\)</span></li>\n<li>闭项在标准模型中有确定值</li>\n<li>数码都是闭项</li>\n<li>闭项在给定结构中有与赋值无关的值；在标准算术结构中，该值可由项的有限递归求值计算</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term, see [[92-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedTerm}_G(t) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{FV}_G(t)=\\emptyset","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(t) = \\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S0","display":false},{"tex":"SS0 + S0","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"v_1 + S0","display":false}],"bytes":966,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-strength.md]]\n[[92-df-consistent.md]]\n[[92-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[92-df-contradiction.md]]\n[[92-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[92-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[92-df-definability.md]]\n[[92-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[92-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[92-df-encoding-completeness.md]]\n[[92-df-enumerable.md]]\n[[92-df-expressible.md]]\n[[92-df-exp